      "citations": null,
      "text": "This script reads only the first block of the file (Average Value Weighted Returns, Monthly) and builds the reversal factor as the average of the two Low-prior-return portfolios minus the average of the two High-prior-return portfolios, across both size groups. Months with any missing input in those four portfolios are dropped.\n\n```python\nimport re\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\n\nSRC = \"6_Portfolios_ME_Prior_1_0.csv\"\nOUT = \"output.csv\"\n\n\ndef is_missing(v):\n    return (abs(v + 99.99) < 1e-6) or (abs(v + 999.0) < 1e-6)\n\n\ndef main():\n    with open(SRC, encoding=\"latin-1\") as f:\n        lines = f.read().splitlines()\n\n    # Locate the first monthly value-weighted table\n    start = None\n    for i, l in enumerate(lines):\n        if \"value weighted returns\" in l.lower() and \"monthly\" in l.lower():\n            start = i\n            break\n    if start is None:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"Monthly value-weighted table not found\")\n\n    records = []\n    started = False\n    for l in lines[start + 1:]:\n        parts = [p.strip() for p in l.split(\",\")]\n        if parts and re.fullmatch(r\"\\d{6}\", parts[0]) and len(parts) >= 7:\n            vals = []\n            ok = True\n            for p in parts[1:7]:\n                try:\n                    v = float(p)\n                except ValueError:\n                    ok = False\n                    break\n                vals.append(np.nan if is_missing(v) else v)\n            if not ok:\n                if started:\n                    break\n                continue\n            records.append([int(parts[0])] + vals)\n            started = True\n        elif started:\n            # end of the monthly block\n            break\n\n    df = pd.DataFrame(\n        records,\n        columns=[\"date\", \"SL\", \"ML\", \"SH\", \"BL\", \"MB\", \"BH\"],\n    )\n\n    # Column order in file: SMALL LoPRIOR, ME1 PRIOR2, SMALL HiPRIOR,\n    #                       BIG LoPRIOR, ME2 PRIOR2, BIG HiPRIOR\n    # ST_Rev = 0.5*(Small Lo + Big Lo) - 0.5*(Small Hi + Big Hi)\n    df = df.dropna(subset=[\"SL\", \"SH\", \"BL\", \"BH\"]).copy()\n    df[\"value\"] = 0.5 * (df[\"SL\"] + df[\"BL\"]) - 0.5 * (df[\"SH\"] + df[\"BH\"])\n\n    out = pd.DataFrame({\n        \"date\": df[\"date\"].astype(int),\n        \"value\": df[\"value\"].astype(float),\n    })\n    out.to_csv(OUT, index=False)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
